    "declared_before": "any development fit at full protocol or candidate score",
    "development_hosts": "arcw0-arcw3 (three held-out months each, 16 threads); selection, export and verification on the workstation",
    "smoke_test": "Before this declaration the development tool's code path was exercised once per held-out month with --smoke (30,000 subsampled training rows, every cap at 60 rounds, outputs in the session scratch directory, since deleted) and the --select path once on those outputs; an index-alignment bug in the selection's pooled candidate scope error was fixed as a result (it raised, no number was produced). Those runs scored no candidate at protocol and are not development results."
